<graph edgedefault="undirected"><node id="AirAsia Boarding Queue at Airport Apron (image)">
  <data key="d0">AirAsia Boarding Queue at Airport Apron (image)</data>
  <data key="d1">image</data>
  <data key="d2">The image depicts travelers boarding a red AirAsia aircraft via outdoor stairs. The scene conveys the commencement of an international journey, referencing the surrounding travel diary context and airline themes, and visually documents the travel experience.</data>
