<node id="Group photo at Dhamek Stupa in Sarnath with China-India Study Tour Vlog overlay (image)">
  <data key="d0">Group photo at Dhamek Stupa in Sarnath with China-India Study Tour Vlog overlay (image)</data>
  <data key="d1">image</data>
  <data key="d2">This image documents a multi-person outdoor scene at the Dhamek Stupa in Sarnath, blending local color, travel, and educational exchange. The overlayed text cues the image as part of a China-India vlog and ties directly to the surrounding content on travel and cultural learning.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-be637c458bcdbfb3651c9ba0d1c7baf5</data>
