  <data key="d5">1764232776</data>
</node>
<node id="AirAsia airplane boarding scene at airport under blue sky (image)">
  <data key="d0">AirAsia airplane boarding scene at airport under blue sky (image)</data>
  <data key="d1">image</data>
  <data key="d2">This image shows travelers boarding an AirAsia Airbus jet via a portable staircase on a sunny airport tarmac. It visually documents the start of a journey described in the travel diary, directly connecting to the context of departure and AirAsia-related content.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-415708471f1973d9b785639ec593474e</data>
  <data key="d4">旅行日记2.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1764232798</data>
</node>
<node id="Hand holding spread of Indian 500-rupee banknotes (image)">
  <data key="d0">Hand holding spread of Indian 500-rupee banknotes (image)</data>
  <data key="d1">image</data>
  <data key="d2">A detailed view of a hand fanning Indian 500-rupee notes, emphasizing currency for travel. Relevant to discussions of travel finance or documenting a trip, correlating with references to Air Asia and Indian currency in the surrounding text.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-e39075bfe38b076a3676b3d6d5c4aa11</data>
  <data key="d4">旅行日记2.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1764232827</data>
</node>
<node id="Group Photo at Dhamek Stupa, Sarnath, India (image)">
  <data key="d0">Group Photo at Dhamek Stupa, Sarnath, India (image)</data>
  <data key="d1">image</data>
  <data key="d2">A group of locals and a tourist pose in front of the Dhamek Stupa in Sarnath, India. The scene highlights a study-travel vlog, dated 2023.12.27-2024.01.10, connecting with surrounding references to Indian sites, currency, and travel experiences.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-2811eca87f0e845a65641f27befe90d1</data>
  <data key="d4">旅行日记2.pdf</data>
